<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4246] .NET: IgniteDbConfiguration initializes incorrectly</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4246</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1) Loaded event handler is static. We should avoid subscribing multiple times.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Loaded event handler should check whether context in question actually needs caching&lt;br/&gt;
3) Add a way to configure EF caching without inheriting IgniteDbConfiguration&lt;/p&gt;</description>
